# ---- Commandx frontend configuration ----
# Copy to .env to override. In development you usually need NOTHING here — the
# Vite dev server proxies /api to the backend (http://localhost:4000) so the
# browser talks to a single origin and cookies work automatically.

# Backend origin used by the dev-server proxy (see vite.config.ts).
# VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:4000

# In PRODUCTION, if the backend is served from a different origin than the
# frontend, set its absolute base URL here (e.g. https://api.commandx.app).
# Requests then go directly there with credentials. Leave empty when the
# backend is reverse-proxied under the same origin at /api.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
